              "text": "Several boutique law firms based in **Chermside** and **North Lakes** specialize in family law and wills & estates, offering cost-certain or flexible billing options:\n\n---\n\n### **North Lakes Boutique Firms**\n\n* **Cornerstone Law Offices**\n  * **Practice Areas:** Family Law, Wills & Estates, Conveyancing.\n  * **Free Initial Consultation:** Offers a free initial telephone consultation to discuss your situation.\n  * **Fixed Fees:** Provides fixed-fee options for standard estate planning (wills and Enduring Powers of Attorney).\n\n* **North Brisbane Law**\n  * **Practice Areas:** Family Law, Wills & Estates, Deceased Estates.\n  * **Free Initial Consultation:** Offers a **free 15-minute discovery call** with a family/estates lawyer to evaluate your situation, followed by a discounted first appointment if you choose to proceed.\n  * **Fixed Fees:** Offers fixed pricing for standard wills and estate administration packages.\n\n* **Koolik & Associates Lawyers**\n  * **Practice Areas:** Family Law, Wills & Estates.\n  * **Free Initial Consultation:** Provides a free, no-obligation initial phone consultation.\n  * **Fixed Fees:** Known for transparent, staged **fixed-fee packages** for both family law matters and will drafting.\n\n* **Cooke & Hutchinson Lawyers**\n  * **Practice Areas:** Wills & Estates, Estate Litigation, Commercial & Elder Law.\n  * **Pricing Options:** Specializes in wills and estates with **guaranteed fixed pricing** for estate planning, powers of attorney, and probate administration.\n\n* **Best Wilson Buckley Family Law (North Lakes Office)**\n  * **Practice Areas:** Specialist Family Law (and associated estate planning/settlement matters).\n  * **Deferred-Fee Options:** Offers internal **deferred-fee arrangements** (paying legal fees from your property settlement proceeds) for eligible clients, and partners with **JustFund** to provide deferred credit lines repaid at settlement.\n\n---\n\n### **Chermside Boutique Firms**\n\n* **Northside Family Law Centre**\n  * **Location:** Directly opposite Westfield Chermside (Gympie Rd / Kingsmill St).\n  * **Practice Areas:** Family Law and Wills & Estates.\n  * **Free Initial Consultation:** Offers a **free 20-minute over-the-phone consultation** to assess your matter.\n  * **Fixed Fees:** Offers fixed-fee arrangements for standard estate planning documents (wills, enduring powers of attorney) and uncontested family law steps.\n\n* **Barton Family Lawyers**\n  * **Location:** Gympie Road, Chermside (also in Petrie).\n  * **Practice Areas:** Specialist Family Law.\n  * **Deferred-Fee Options:** Explicitly offers **Deferred Fixed Fees (\"Pay at the End\")**. Fees can be deferred until matter conclusion and paid directly out of property settlement proceeds (subject to assessment during your initial meeting). They also offer **JustFund** financing.\n  * **Pricing:** Fixed-fee stages for all family law work; initial consults are offered at a reduced rate.\n\n* **LGM Family Law**\n  * **Location:** Chermside.\n  * **Practice Areas:** Family Law & Property Settlements.\n  * **Free Initial Consultation:** Offers a **free 15-minute phone consultation** to discuss your case and explain potential pathways before committing to a paid comprehensive advice session.\n\n* **Pennisi Zia Lawyers**\n  * **Location:** Chermside.\n  * **Practice Areas:** Wills & Estates, Probate, Estate Litigation, Family Law.\n  * **Fixed Fees:** Transparent **fixed-fee structures** for standard will drafting, succession planning, and estate administration.\n  * **Deferred Fees for Estates:** For deceased estate administration and probate, legal fees are generally deferred and paid directly out of the estate account once funds are liquidated.\n\n---\n\n### **Quick Comparison of Billing Models**\n\n| Law Firm | Location | Free Initial Call? | Fixed-Fee Wills? | Deferred Fees Available? |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Cornerstone Law** | North Lakes | Yes (Free consult) | Yes | Inquire based on matter |\n| **North Brisbane Law** | North Lakes | Yes (15-min call) | Yes | Estate administration only |\n| **Koolik & Associates** | North Lakes | Yes (Phone consult) | Yes | Payment plans available |\n| **Best Wilson Buckley** | North Lakes | No (Fixed initial fee) | Referral / In-house | **Yes** (Deferred at settlement / JustFund) |\n| **Northside Family Law** | Chermside | Yes (20-min call) | Yes | Case-by-case |\n| **Barton Family Lawyers**| Chermside | Reduced fee initial | Family law only | **Yes** (Deferred fixed fees / JustFund) |\n| **Pennisi Zia Lawyers** | Chermside | Case-by-case | Yes (Transparent fixed)| Yes (Estate administration) |\n\n---\n\n### **Important Things to Keep in Mind**\n1. **Scope of Free Consultations:** At boutique firms, a \"free consultation\" is usually a **15- to 20-minute triage call**. This allows the lawyer to review your circumstances, ensure there are no conflicts of interest, and provide a fee quote. In-depth legal strategy sessions (typically 60–90 minutes with document review) are usually charged at an agreed fixed fee.\n2. **Deferred Fees Eligibility:** \n   * **Family Law:** Deferred payment (\"pay at settlement\") is generally only approved for **property and financial settlements** where there is identifiable real estate or superannuation that guarantees funds will exist at the conclusion of the matter. \n   * **Wills & Estates:** Standard wills are almost always billed as a one-time fixed fee upfront. However, **Probate, Letters of Administration, and Estate Litigation** can frequently be deferred until the estate assets are called in or the dispute settles.",
